The '''Void Slate''' is a sub-location of [[The End]]. 

{{ZoneText
|Perform Draconic Sacrifices.
|Spend &dDragon Essence&f.}}

== Features ==
The '''Void Slate''' features a few attractions.

=== Tyzzo ===
{{Main|Tyzzo}}
[[Tyzzo]] is an [[NPC]] located in the '''Void Slate'''. They offer the player a guide to Draconic sacrifices, explaining the rewards from sacrificing certain items, including their rarity and amount. [[Tyzzo]] also has a [[Essence Shop]] for [[Dragon Essence]], where the player can spend [[Essence]] on [[The End|End]]-related perks.

=== Draconic Altar ===
{{Main|Draconic Altar}}
Situated next to [[Tyzzo]] is the [[Draconic Altar]], where players can perform sacrifices. The player can offer an [[The End|End]]-related piece of gear to receive a variety of items and some [[Dragon Essence]].

